{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KanjiFlash: Master Japanese Kana &amp; Ky\u014diku Kanji</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KanjiFlash is a three\u2011layer flash\u2011card and quiz suite that systematically teaches Grades\u202f1\u20136 Ky\u014diku kanji, both kana systems, and core vocabulary. With over 1\u202f000 kanji, 1\u202f000 vocab entries, and 100+ Meiji\u2011era images, it guides you from visual cues to pure character recognition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grades\u202f1\u20136 Kanji</strong>: All 1\u202f006 Ky\u014diku characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kana Training</strong>: Hiragana, katakana, dakuten &amp; handakuten</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1\u202f000+ Vocabulary</strong>: Contextual examples using previously learned kanji</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Word of the Day</strong>: Daily kanji or vocab prompt</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 Mini\u2011Games</strong> for reinforcement:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Text RPG: Explore a world made of Kanji</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balloon Pop: Let the designated Kanji balloon through and pop the others!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vocab Match: Pair Kanji to learn their definitions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tracing Program</strong>: Stroke\u2011order practice with instant feedback</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100+ Illustrations</strong>: Primarily Grade\u202f1\u20132 images, gradually reduced to build pure recognition</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clean Interface</strong>: Focused on repetition and mastery</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get hands\u2011on kanji practice, build reading skills for JLPT, signs, menus and beyond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: there is no sound as of yet, I recommend playing classical music in the background while playing.\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3704680?t=1750120805","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704680/e22a24faab781c7781b55da6407fa6a1626c899c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750120805","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704680/c8454505db2c069c3a4f0b361b79df6440adce40/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750120805","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704680/c8454505db2c069c3a4f0b361b79df6440adce40/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750120805","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KanjiFlash: Master Japanese Kana &amp; Ky\u014diku Kanji</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KanjiFlash is a three\u2011layer flash\u2011card and quiz suite that systematically teaches Grades\u202f1\u20136 Ky\u014diku kanji, both kana systems, and core vocabulary. With over 1\u202f000 kanji, 1\u202f000 vocab entries, and 100+ Meiji\u2011era images, it guides you from visual cues to pure character recognition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grades\u202f1\u20136 Kanji</strong>: All 1\u202f006 Ky\u014diku characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kana Training</strong>: Hiragana, katakana, dakuten &amp; handakuten</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1\u202f000+ Vocabulary</strong>: Contextual examples using previously learned kanji</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Word of the Day</strong>: Daily kanji or vocab prompt</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 Mini\u2011Games</strong> for reinforcement:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"